# React frontend

Use function components. Route with react-router-dom. Style with Tailwind and shadcn components in `packages/ui` or `apps/web/src/components/ui`.

Colors come from CSS variables (`--primary`, `--background`). Do not hardcode a second palette. Copy comes from `src/locales/en/*.json`.

PWA: keep `manifest.webmanifest` and the app shell. Do not add push notifications.

```tsx
// BAD
<button style={{ background: "red" }}>Save</button>
// GOOD
<Button type="submit">{t("save")}</Button>
```
